---
// Pixel-art me, drawn as ASCII grids (one char per pixel) and turned into SVG at build time.
// Layers move on their own: the upper body breathes, the eyes blink,
// the arm waves on click. Behaviour lives in scripts/me.ts; without it he just stands there.
//
// Sampled cell by cell from the reference portrait (14 px cells, colours taken from the image),
// then cleaned up by hand: transparent backdrop, the lanyard repainted, a raised arm for the wave.
// Palette: a/b outline · c/d/e/f shirt and hair · g/h skin · i white · j/k/l/m beard · t/u jeans
//          R Y U G lanyard · ~ floor shadow · '.' transparent
